1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 5=

4
00:01:02,390 --> 00:01:03,600
You've been practicing for hours.

5
00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:04,790
Can't you take a break?

6
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:07,640
I only have

7
00:01:07,870 --> 00:01:08,870
three days.

8
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:11,230
I need to practice
until the Crown Prince

9
00:01:11,590 --> 00:01:13,200
has eyes for no one but me.

10
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:37,280
Are you practicing
a dance or an assassination?

11
00:01:38,590 --> 00:01:40,230
These steps are too difficult.

12
00:01:40,510 --> 00:01:42,000
I don't think I can learn them.

13
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,150
Step on my feet.

14
00:01:55,350 --> 00:01:56,280
Your Highness.

15
00:01:57,070 --> 00:01:58,040
You know this dance too?

16
00:01:58,510 --> 00:02:00,280
Did you think I was as slow as you?

17
00:02:02,310 --> 00:02:03,840
Isn't this a little improper?

18
00:02:07,980 --> 00:02:14,090
♪One thought of youth, laughing side
by side, I made a promise with you♪

19
00:02:15,050 --> 00:02:21,480
♪One wish left unfulfilled, so close,
yet no words can be spoken♪

20
00:02:21,930 --> 00:02:27,630
♪Leaving one soul alone, looking back
again between heaven and earth♪

21
00:02:28,070 --> 00:02:35,500
♪How should I remember?
How should I say goodbye?♪

22
00:02:35,850 --> 00:02:41,920
♪One thought of those years,
both a dream and yet so real♪

23
00:02:42,810 --> 00:02:49,520
♪One thought waits for the snow,
shining bright in my memories♪

24
00:02:49,730 --> 00:02:55,560
♪Remembering a past life,
with no regrets for this chapter♪

25
00:02:55,880 --> 00:03:02,770
♪Can I still hope
that someday we'll meet again?♪

26
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,630
Your Highness.

27
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:17,120
With you teaching me like this,

28
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:20,030
I really don't seem to stumble as much.

29
00:03:21,870 --> 00:03:22,470
You...

30
00:03:22,590 --> 00:03:24,190
Why are you so stiff?

31
00:03:24,190 --> 00:03:25,120
Are you tired?

32
00:03:29,630 --> 00:03:30,430
Focus.

33
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:33,820
♪With no regrets for this chapter♪

34
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:40,890
♪Can I still hope
that someday we'll meet again?♪

35
00:03:41,690 --> 00:03:44,970
♪Can I still hope that someday♪

36
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,400
Thank you, Your Highness.

37
00:03:46,750 --> 00:03:48,400
I think I've got it now.

38
00:03:48,610 --> 00:03:52,660
♪We'll meet again?♪

39
00:03:57,470 --> 00:03:58,280
He Xiaoyuan.

40
00:03:59,150 --> 00:04:00,310
What kind of woman

41
00:04:00,310 --> 00:04:01,470
cares so little about her own hair?

42
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:25,040
Your Highness.

43
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:27,160
There really is nothing you can't do.

44
00:04:28,630 --> 00:04:29,240
Well...

45
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:31,190
There's actually
a sash I don't know how to tie.

46
00:04:31,190 --> 00:04:31,600
Could you...

47
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:32,000
No.

48
00:04:34,430 --> 00:04:35,720
You're a young lady.

49
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:36,720
Tie it yourself.

50
00:04:40,510 --> 00:04:43,270
Didn't I make progress
with my dancing today?

51
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,950
Why does he look even angrier?

52
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:57,270
How can there be a woman like you?

53
00:04:57,750 --> 00:04:58,800
You're so clumsy.

54
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,630
You can't even tie your own sash.

55
00:05:02,390 --> 00:05:05,480
Women come in all kinds.

56
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:08,870
You're the one
insisting I become Mu Tingting.

57
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,950
You're getting bolder by the day.

58
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:51,600
Don't move.

59
00:06:10,950 --> 00:06:12,070
(Have I)

60
00:06:12,070 --> 00:06:13,270
(worn myself out
from all this training?)

61
00:06:13,600 --> 00:06:14,920
(Why is my heart beating so fast?)

62
00:06:24,270 --> 00:06:25,390
At tonight's banquet,

63
00:06:26,430 --> 00:06:27,950
for your own sake

64
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,600
and for mine,

65
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,270
you must win.

66
00:06:47,190 --> 00:06:48,870
The grand prize
at today's flower-viewing banquet

67
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:50,310
is the century-old lingzhi.

68
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:52,190
All the noble ladies
have given it their all,

69
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:53,270
competing in poetry and calligraphy,

70
00:06:53,270 --> 00:06:54,360
then music and dance.

71
00:06:54,750 --> 00:06:55,720
Your Highness,

72
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:58,720
why keep all the ladies waiting

73
00:06:59,190 --> 00:07:01,040
for a mere Princess's Study Companion?

74
00:07:01,620 --> 00:07:02,720
What's wrong
with being a study companion?

75
00:07:03,190 --> 00:07:03,830
Yu Feilin,

76
00:07:04,190 --> 00:07:05,040
who are you looking down on?

77
00:07:05,950 --> 00:07:07,070
I'm not looking down on anyone.

78
00:07:07,800 --> 00:07:08,560
It's just that

79
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,240
a mere study companion

80
00:07:10,750 --> 00:07:12,360
surely can't compare with Your Highness

81
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:14,310
or the other noble ladies in talent.

82
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,600
Exactly, Your Highness.

83
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,190
Please announce the winner.

84
00:07:17,430 --> 00:07:18,630
Why wait

85
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:19,800
for a mere study companion?

86
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:20,360
Exactly.

87
00:07:20,560 --> 00:07:21,630
- This flower-viewing banquet
- Exactly.

88
00:07:21,950 --> 00:07:24,040
is quite entertaining, with everyone
trying to outshine one another.

89
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,040
Your Highness,

90
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,800
look at Miss Yu

91
00:07:26,830 --> 00:07:27,950
and those noble ladies down there.

92
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,720
Don't they look like
they can't stand losing to Yun Fang?

93
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,360
Exactly.

94
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:35,360
My seventh brother treats me best.

95
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:39,750
Don't worry, Young Lady.

96
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,000
Everything has been arranged.

97
00:07:41,270 --> 00:07:42,480
She won't be getting out tonight.

98
00:08:29,190 --> 00:08:30,800
Her beauty is as pure as peach blossoms,

99
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:32,510
her melody as graceful as spring waters.

100
00:08:33,270 --> 00:08:33,600
She...

101
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:36,320
She's like a fairy descended
from the Moon Palace.

102
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:36,720
Indeed.

103
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:33,150
She soars through
the air like a swallow,

104
00:09:33,550 --> 00:09:34,750
and flutters among
the flowers like a butterfly.

105
00:09:35,150 --> 00:09:35,910
Xiaoyuan.

106
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,910
When did you become
such an accomplished dancer?

107
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:12,670
I

108
00:10:12,960 --> 00:10:14,480
pay my respects to Your Highness.

109
00:10:20,550 --> 00:10:21,320
He Xiaoyuan

110
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,550
guided the wine cup with her strings,

111
00:10:22,650 --> 00:10:23,940
with flowers and moonlight
enhancing her performance.

112
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,030
I hereby declare

113
00:10:25,390 --> 00:10:27,080
the winner of today's
flower-viewing banquet.

114
00:10:27,670 --> 00:10:28,600
The honor belongs to her.

115
00:10:30,510 --> 00:10:31,320
Thank you, Your Highness.

116
00:10:45,630 --> 00:10:46,200
What's wrong?

117
00:10:46,750 --> 00:10:47,150
Does it hurt?

118
00:10:48,150 --> 00:10:49,240
Why didn't you stop?

119
00:10:50,150 --> 00:10:51,750
As long as Your Highness likes it,

120
00:10:52,270 --> 00:10:53,320
it doesn't hurt at all.

121
00:11:01,150 --> 00:11:01,960
What are you doing?

122
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:03,960
Your Highness said

123
00:11:04,270 --> 00:11:05,240
the Crown Prince is softhearted

124
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:06,790
and is especially
sympathetic to the vulnerable.

125
00:11:08,670 --> 00:11:10,870
What a foolish
and unnecessary thing to do.

126
00:11:14,390 --> 00:11:15,120
How

127
00:11:15,550 --> 00:11:17,000
can I not worry when you're like this?

128
00:11:29,910 --> 00:11:31,150
Didn't the plan work?

129
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,080
Then why do you

130
00:11:33,750 --> 00:11:34,720
look so unhappy?

131
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,120
Go

132
00:11:38,790 --> 00:11:40,840
and get the puppeteer
who helped her fly out of here.

133
00:11:41,720 --> 00:11:42,200
Yes.

134
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,720
Take the secluded path over there.

135
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:55,870
Make sure no one sees you.

136
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:56,960
Yes.

137
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:02,440
(Fu Yang.)

138
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:05,200
(He Xiaoyuan's boat had
been deliberately punctured,)

139
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,730
(she shouldn't have been able
to attend the flower-viewing banquet.)

140
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:09,910
(I never expected the person who
secretly arranged another way for her)

141
00:12:10,670 --> 00:12:11,870
(to be none other
than the Seventh Prince.)

142
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,630
He Xiaoyuan.

143
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:27,200
You used delivering a letter
to the Princess as an excuse

144
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:29,080
to ingratiate yourself with
the Seventh Prince at Qingyan Palace.

145
00:12:29,550 --> 00:12:30,960
Quite a clever scheme.

146
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,600
What do you mean, Young Lady Yu?

147
00:12:32,870 --> 00:12:33,870
I don't understand.

148
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,600
Don't think I don't know

149
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:37,270
how you feel about the Crown Prince.

150
00:12:37,550 --> 00:12:39,570
Don't think that currying favor
with those around His Highness

151
00:12:39,570 --> 00:12:40,770
will help you marry
into the royal family.

152
00:12:41,670 --> 00:12:42,550
Let me tell you,

153
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:45,510
even if you want to become
His Highness's concubine one day,

154
00:12:45,550 --> 00:12:47,360
you'll have to ask
whether I'll allow it first.

155
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:49,390
You're absolutely right, Young Lady Yu.

156
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:50,720
But

157
00:12:50,720 --> 00:12:53,000
save your worry
till you're mistress of the Eastern Palace.

158
00:12:54,670 --> 00:12:55,150
You...

159
00:12:56,140 --> 00:12:58,140
(Qingyan Palace)

160
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:11,510
Fu Yang.

161
00:13:12,030 --> 00:13:13,390
The Crown Prince invited me

162
00:13:13,390 --> 00:13:15,360
to visit him after I finish
at Qingshan Temple

163
00:13:15,550 --> 00:13:17,200
so we can exchange
pointers on the zither.

164
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:18,630
I

165
00:13:18,630 --> 00:13:20,120
just got the hang of the pipa,

166
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,510
and now there's the zither.

167
00:13:23,670 --> 00:13:24,510
So,

168
00:13:24,790 --> 00:13:26,150
is the Seventh Prince available?

169
00:13:26,150 --> 00:13:27,360
His Highness isn't here at the moment.

170
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:29,150
Please return
another time, Miss Xiaoyuan.

171
00:13:30,750 --> 00:13:32,510
(Could Zhao Boqing)

172
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:34,000
(still be angry with me)

173
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:36,440
(for biting my finger
without asking him that day?)

174
00:13:55,340 --> 00:13:58,340
(Celestial Realm Beyond the Clouds)

175
00:14:09,790 --> 00:14:11,750
(This royal blessing ceremony)

176
00:14:11,910 --> 00:14:13,240
(really is taking a long time.)

177
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:15,840
He Xiaoyuan.

178
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:18,000
The Princess asked you to wait
at the Matchmaker's Shrine.

179
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,630
(Matchmaker's Shrine?)

180
00:14:21,390 --> 00:14:23,630
(Looks like the Princess plans
to finish the blessing ceremony)

181
00:14:23,630 --> 00:14:25,240
(and then pray
for a match with Fu Yang.)

182
00:14:25,670 --> 00:14:27,120
(She really never gives up.)

183
00:14:34,340 --> 00:14:35,700
(Matchmaker Hall)

184
00:14:41,750 --> 00:14:42,600
Where is the Princess?

185
00:14:42,910 --> 00:14:44,390
Her Highness hasn't finished
the blessing ceremony yet.

186
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:45,630
She asked you to wait here for a while.

187
00:14:46,390 --> 00:14:46,910
Thank you.

188
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:14,320
(He Xiaoyuan.)

189
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,910
(You dare threaten
my place as Crown Princess.)

190
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:18,870
(You've brought this upon yourself.)

191
00:15:28,210 --> 00:15:30,520
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

192
00:15:30,870 --> 00:15:32,560
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

193
00:15:33,190 --> 00:15:36,200
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

194
00:15:36,710 --> 00:15:41,040
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

195
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:43,780
♪My heart has long known♪

196
00:15:44,250 --> 00:15:46,220
♪We made a promise long ago♪

197
00:15:46,550 --> 00:15:48,170
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

198
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:52,160
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

199
00:15:52,470 --> 00:15:55,320
♪How much must I let go♪

200
00:15:55,640 --> 00:15:57,320
♪For one moment♪

201
00:15:57,590 --> 00:16:00,330
♪To hold each other close♪

202
00:16:00,540 --> 00:16:04,860
♪Would that be enough?♪
